---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: null
description: Roman Charleston documents cloud security assessments, telemetry pipelines, and forensic investigations with inspectable source material.
---
<section class="hero" style="text-align:center;align-items:center;">
  <div class="hero-inner" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;">
    <h1 style="text-align:center;">Cloud security.<br>Clear evidence.<br><em>Practical GRC.</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">// Roman Charleston · Security &amp; GRC</p>
    <p class="hero-desc" style="text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;">I connect technical security work to understandable risk. Explore the labs, source material, and reasoning behind my cloud assessments and investigations.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions" style="justify-content:center;">
      <a href="/projects/" class="btn-primary">View projects →</a>
      <a href="/blog/" class="btn-ghost">Read the blog</a>
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn-ghost">Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="stats-strip">
  <div class="stat-item">
    <div class="stat-num">3</div>
    <div class="stat-lbl">Documented Labs</div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-item">
    <div class="stat-num">2</div>
    <div class="stat-lbl">Cloud Platforms</div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-item">
    <div class="stat-num">3yr</div>
    <div class="stat-lbl">Cybersecurity Experience</div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-item">
    <div class="stat-num">3</div>
    <div class="stat-lbl">Published Walkthroughs</div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="section">
  <div class="section-header fade-in">
    <div class="section-left">
      <div class="section-tag">// 01 — Portfolio</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Featured<br><em>projects</em></h2>
    </div>
    <p class="section-desc">Start with the AWS assessment, follow the Azure telemetry pipeline, or work through a forensic timeline.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="projects-grid">
    {% for p in projects %}{% if p.status == "completed" %}
      {% include "partials/project-card.njk" %}
    {% endif %}{% endfor %}
  </div>

  <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:40px;">
    <a href="/projects/" class="btn-ghost">View labs &amp; roadmap →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<hr class="sec-div">

<section class="section">
  <div class="section-header fade-in">
    <div class="section-left">
      <div class="section-tag">// 02 — Latest writing</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">From the<br><em>blog</em></h2>
    </div>
    <p class="section-desc">Technical writing on GRC engineering, automation, and building compliant cloud infrastructure.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="blog-grid fade-in">{% for post in writing %}<a href="{{ post.url }}" class="blog-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><div class="blog-meta">{{ post.date }} · {{ post.tag }}</div><div class="blog-title">{{ post.title }}</div><div class="blog-excerpt">{{ post.description }}</div><span class="blog-link">Read on Medium ↗</span></a>{% endfor %}</div>
</section>
